WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.780
Whose family do you belong

2
00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.285
to, your father's or your

3
00:00:03.285 --> 00:00:05.710
mother's? Kinship systems answer that

4
00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:06.940
differently.

5
00:00:07.295 --> 00:00:09.795
Patrilineal systems trace descent through

6
00:00:09.795 --> 00:00:10.629
the father.

7
00:00:10.629 --> 00:00:12.744
Matrilineal, through the mother.

8
00:00:12.744 --> 00:00:14.872
Bilateral, through both.

9
00:00:15.197 --> 00:00:16.649
Couples may live with the

10
00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:17.643
husband's family,

11
00:00:17.643 --> 00:00:18.721
or the wife's.

12
00:00:18.721 --> 00:00:19.955
Or set up a new

13
00:00:19.955 --> 00:00:20.892
home.

14
00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:23.682
Murdock claimed in 1949 that

15
00:00:23.682 --> 00:00:26.717
the nuclear family is universal.

16
00:00:26.717 --> 00:00:28.629
Studies of matrilineal groups,

17
00:00:28.629 --> 00:00:29.737
like the Nayars,

18
00:00:29.737 --> 00:00:31.200
challenge that.

19
00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:33.145
Your turn.

20
00:00:33.145 --> 00:00:34.951
What is it called?
